@startuml
[*] --> Idle State
Idle State --> [*] : System Shutdown

Idle State --> Event Created : User creates new appointment/event
Event Created --> Analyzing Schedule and Preferences : System analyzes user's schedule and preferences
Analyzing Schedule and Preferences --> Suggesting Reminders : System suggests reminders based on analysis
Suggesting Reminders --> Setting Reminders : User accepts suggested reminders
Setting Reminders --> [*] : Reminders set and system returns to idle

Suggesting Reminders --> Idle State : User declines suggested reminders
@enduml
